{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "NrLoggingCountyRun",
    "description": "The run-level assembly for PLAN.md §3 Phase 2: all seven stages of the nr-logging-county chain, one .esm each, mounted here by reference and joined across the mounts.\n\nWHAT IT PROVES. The leaves' own inline tests check each stage against docs/nonroad-logging-county.md's worked examples. This document checks the thing no leaf can: that the stages COMPOSE — that the population stage's state population times the geography stage's allocation fraction is the number the roll-up stage was given, that the activity stage's hours and temporal factors are the ones the roll-up multiplies by, and that the emission-factor stage's rate for the technology the mix selects is the one the deterioration coefficients apply to. `chainEmissionGrams` recomputes the four model-year-2020 rows of §6.1 END TO END from six mounted leaves' outputs, touching none of the roll-up leaf's own constants, and lands on 269.1395, 1205.140, 6.923390 and 44.16037 grams.\n\nENUMS DO NOT CROSS THE MOUNT EITHER. THE UNION OF EVERY MOUNTED LEAF'S ENUMS, restated here because they do not cross a top-level `models` {ref} mount (docs/findings F13). esm-spec §9.3 gives one inheritance path for enums -- a §4.7 subsystem ref, which inherits the REFERENCED file's block -- and this is not it, so a mounted leaf's `enum` op is resolved against THIS document's registry and fails on any symbol this document does not declare. Every value below is copied from the leaf that owns it and they agree symbol by symbol; a disagreement would be a silent relabelling, so tools/check-conventions.py compares them.\n\nMOUNT FORM AND ITS COST. Each leaf is a top-level `models` entry that is a `{ref}`, reached by scoped name (docs/esm-conventions.md §5). The nested `subsystems` form PLAN.md §3 assumed drops a leaf's `join.on` key columns (docs/findings F1), and every leaf here joins on data columns. The cost is that index sets do not merge across the edge (F2), so this document restates all sixty-one axes of the ten files it mounts; tools/check-conventions.py compares them against each leaf's own declaration and fails on disagreement, standing in for the merge the loader does not perform.\n\nWHAT IS STILL MISSING, AND IT IS NOT AUTHORING. Two upstream blockers stand between this document and the 144-row fixture comparison, and neither is a matter of writing more .esm. The CLI wires no PrepareProvider, so a `data_sources` entry loads nothing and every relation here is an inline transcription of the snapshot rather than a read of it (build-esm.sh, KNOWN BLOCKER; sources/nr_logging_county.esm carries the declarations, ready). And there is no route from a computed relation to a file at all: `esm test` asserts but does not emit, and `esm simulate --output` insists on an ODE solve that a document with no D() equation cannot provide (docs/findings F9). A third gap is the document's own: agedist.f's thirty-year fold is a recurrence the format cannot express (F12), so the grown model-year fractions enter components/age_distribution.esm as data.\n\nSCALING TO THREE SCCs, WHICH IS ADDING ROWS. The fixture's key set is ragged: 36 (SCC, modelYearID) pairs whose model-year counts are 3, 4 and 29, because each equipment point's span is its own scrptime nyrlif. Nothing here is a rectangle over SCC and model year, and nothing should be -- components/movesoutput_aggregation.esm carries the key as three COLUMNS over one row axis, so the fixture's 144 rows are 12 plus 16 plus 116 concatenated and no equation changes. A shared [SCC x modelYear x pollutant] grid would carry 348 keys against the snapshot's 144, which fails the exact-key-set check rather than any number; the `ragged` per-parent axis the schema advertises for this is not usable either (docs/findings F14). What the second and third SCCs need is more rows in each leaf's relations -- three equipment points instead of one, three technologies where the mix has three -- and the run's own three key relations widened from one row to three.\n\nSCOPE OF THIS RUN. One SCC, 2260007005, one equipment point, one technology, one model year in the composed check — the §6.1 example, which is the cleanest of the three and the one whose every intermediate the specification prints. The other two SCCs differ only in row counts: §6.2 sums two equipment points into each output row and §6.3 three, which is the same contraction with more input rows.",
    "authors": ["EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"],
    "tags": ["moves", "nonroad", "nr-logging-county", "assembly", "run"]
  },

  "enums": {
    "base_population_year": { "NonroadBaseYear": 1990 },
    "day_type": { "Weekend": 2, "Weekday": 5 },
    "engine_fuel_kind": { "Gasoline2Stroke": 1, "Gasoline4Stroke": 2, "Diesel": 3 },
    "engine_technology": { "G2H5": 121, "G2H51": 123, "G2H5C1": 124, "G2H52": 125, "G4NonHandheld134": 134, "SyntheticRatelessTech": 199, "EvapHandheld": 1001 },
    "equipment_type": { "ChainSaws": 71, "Shredders": 72, "FellerBuncher": 73, "SyntheticDecoy": 99 },
    "fuel_subtype": { "ConventionalGasoline": 10, "ReformulatedGasoline": 11, "GasoholE10": 12, "NonroadDieselFuel": 23, "MarineDieselFuel": 24, "CompressedNaturalGas": 30, "LiquefiedPetroleumGas": 40 },
    "fuel_type": { "Gasoline": 1, "DieselFuel": 2 },
    "growth": { "BasePopulationYear": 1990 },
    "month": { "January": 1, "February": 2, "March": 3, "April": 4, "May": 5, "June": 6, "July": 7, "August": 8, "September": 9, "October": 10, "November": 11, "December": 12 },
    "moves_fuel_type": { "Gasoline": 1 },
    "nonroad_fuel_type": { "Gasoline": 1, "CompressedNaturalGas": 3, "LiquefiedPetroleumGas": 4, "NonroadDiesel": 23, "MarineDiesel": 24 },
    "pollutant": { "TotalGaseousHydrocarbons": 1, "CarbonMonoxide": 2, "OxidesOfNitrogen": 3, "AtmosphericCO2": 90, "BrakeSpecificFuelConsumption": 99, "PrimaryExhaustPM10Total": 100 },
    "process": { "RunningExhaust": 1 },
    "process_group": { "Exhaust": 1, "Evaporative": 2 },
    "region_code": { "OnroadFuelRegion": 1, "NonroadFuelRegion": 2 },
    "road_type": { "Nonroad": 100 },
    "scrappage": { "FullyScrappedPercent": 100 },
    "sector": { "Construction": 2, "Logging": 7 },
    "state": { "Michigan": 26, "Ohio": 39 },
    "surrogate": { "TimberProductOutput": 8, "Population": 9 }
  },

  "index_sets": {
    "activity_point_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 7 },
    "adjustment_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 8 },
    "age_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 51 },
    "allocation_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 2 },
    "allocation_runspec_state_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "allocation_state_scope_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 2 },
    "base_population_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 13 },
    "base_population_year_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "calendar_year_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 2 },
    "day_allocation_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 4 },
    "days_per_month_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 12 },
    "emission_rate_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 25 },
    "engine_fuel_kind_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 3 },
    "engine_tech_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 5 },
    "equipment_hp_point_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "equipment_point_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 6 },
    "equipment_type_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 4 },
    "exhaust_process_group_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "fuel_formulation_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 8 },
    "fuel_runspec_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "fuel_subtype_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 7 },
    "fuel_supply_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 8 },
    "fuel_type_mapping_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "growth_factor_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 31 },
    "growth_finder_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 6 },
    "growth_query_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 33 },
    "growth_runspec_state_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "growth_scc_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 5 },
    "growth_series_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 45 },
    "growth_span_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "growth_state_scope_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 2 },
    "input_tons_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 23 },
    "mix_model_year_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 6 },
    "month_allocation_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 9 },
    "nonroad_fuel_type_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 5 },
    "nonroad_region_code_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "output_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 19 },
    "output_run_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "pollutant_process_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 5 },
    "reformulated_subtype_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "region_county_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 2 },
    "rollup_adjustment_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 4 },
    "rollup_deterioration_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 8 },
    "rollup_factor_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 4 },
    "rollup_mix_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 3 },
    "rollup_model_year_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 3 },
    "rollup_pollutant_process_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 4 },
    "runspec_day_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "runspec_fuel_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 2 },
    "runspec_month_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "runspec_pollutant_process_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 4 },
    "runspec_sector_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "runspec_state_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "scc_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 6 },
    "scrappage_curve_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 197 },
    "surrogate_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 6 },
    "surrogate_target_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 4 },
    "tech_mix_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 23 },
    "time_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 24 },
    "zone_month_hour_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 27 },

    "run_scc_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "run_model_year_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 },
    "run_engine_fuel_kind_rows": { "kind": "interval", "size": 1 }
  },

  "models": {
    "Geography":  { "ref": "../components/geographic_allocation.esm" },
    "Population": { "ref": "../components/equipment_population.esm" },
    "Growth":     { "ref": "../components/growth_index.esm" },
    "Age":        { "ref": "../components/age_distribution.esm" },
    "Activity":   { "ref": "../components/activity_temporal.esm" },
    "Factors":    { "ref": "../components/exhaust_emission_factors.esm" },
    "Adjust":     { "ref": "../components/exhaust_adjustment.esm" },
    "Fuel":       { "ref": "../components/fuel_properties.esm" },
    "Rollup":     { "ref": "../components/exhaust_rollup.esm" },
    "Output":     { "ref": "../components/movesoutput_aggregation.esm" },

    "Chain": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "../lib/emission_factors.esm", "only": ["deterioration_age", "deterioration_factor"] },
        { "ref": "../lib/conversion.esm", "only": ["unit_conversion", "emission_unit_g_per_hp_hr"] }
      ],

      "tolerance": { "rel": 1e-12 },

      "variables": {
        "run_SCC": {
          "type": "unknown", "shape": ["run_scc_rows"],
          "description": "The SCC this run composes end to end: 2260007005, the §6.1 chain saws. Every leaf is scoped to it by a join rather than by a filter, because an SCC is a key."
        },
        "run_modelYearID": {
          "type": "unknown", "shape": ["run_model_year_rows"],
          "description": "The model year the composed check evaluates: 2020, age slot 0. The other two of this SCC's three are checked in the roll-up and output leaves."
        },
        "run_engineFuelKindID": {
          "type": "unknown", "shape": ["run_engine_fuel_kind_rows"],
          "description": "The engine fuel kind of this SCC: two-stroke gasoline, since the SCC begins 2260 (docs/nonroad-logging-county.md §5.3). components/exhaust_adjustment.esm carries both kinds and this is the key that selects one."
        },

        "chainCountyPopulation": {
          "type": "unknown", "units": "1",
          "description": "Stage 1 x stage 2: the equipment population stage's rounded STATE population for this SCC's equipment point, times the geography stage's allocation fraction for the surrogate that SCC allocates through. Neither leaf can compute this; it is the join between them."
        },
        "chainAnnualHours": {
          "type": "unknown", "units": "1",
          "description": "Stage 3's acttmp for this SCC's equipment point."
        },
        "chainMonthDayFactor": {
          "type": "unknown", "units": "1",
          "description": "Stage 3's tpltmp for it."
        },
        "chainUnitConversion": {
          "type": "unknown", "units": "1",
          "description": "unitcf.f applied to stage 3's hpAvg and loadFactor: the same template the roll-up leaf uses, fed from the activity leaf rather than from a parameter."
        },
        "chainDeteriorationAge": {
          "type": "unknown", "units": "1",
          "description": "detage at age slot 0, from stage 3's hours, load factor and median life."
        },
        "chainEmissionGrams": {
          "type": "unknown", "shape": ["rollup_pollutant_process_rows"], "units": "g",
          "description": "The composed answer: grams of each pollutant from model year 2020 of SCC 2260007005 in the run's county-month-day, assembled from six mounted leaves and no local constant except the run's own three keys. Compare against §6.1's results table."
        }
      },

      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "run_SCC",
          "rhs": { "op": "const", "args": [], "value": [2260007005] }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "run_modelYearID",
          "rhs": { "op": "const", "args": [], "value": [2020] }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "run_engineFuelKindID",
          "rhs": { "op": "makearray", "args": [], "regions": [[[1, 1]]],
            "values": [{ "op": "enum", "args": ["engine_fuel_kind", "Gasoline2Stroke"] }] }
        },

        {
          "_comment": "The join PLAN.md §3's stage list implies and neither leaf can make: population is grown on the STATE total and allocated afterwards (§2.1), so the two stages meet exactly here. Both sides are scoped to the run's SCC by their own `join.on` clause.",
          "lhs": "chainCountyPopulation",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate", "args": [], "semiring": "sum_product", "output_idx": [],
            "ranges": { "e": { "from": "equipment_point_rows" }, "s": { "from": "scc_rows" },
                        "r": { "from": "run_scc_rows" } },
            "join": [
              { "on": [["Population.eqp_SCC", "run_SCC"]] },
              { "on": [["Geography.scc_SCC", "run_SCC"]] }
            ],
            "expr": { "op": "*", "args": [
              { "op": "index", "args": ["Population.eqp_statePopulation", "e"] },
              { "op": "index", "args": ["Geography.scc_allocationFraction", "s"] }] }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chainAnnualHours",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate", "args": [], "semiring": "sum_product", "output_idx": [],
            "ranges": { "v": { "from": "activity_point_rows" }, "r": { "from": "run_scc_rows" } },
            "join": [ { "on": [["Activity.act_SCC", "run_SCC"]] } ],
            "expr": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_annualHours", "v"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chainMonthDayFactor",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate", "args": [], "semiring": "sum_product", "output_idx": [],
            "ranges": { "v": { "from": "activity_point_rows" }, "r": { "from": "run_scc_rows" } },
            "join": [ { "on": [["Activity.act_SCC", "run_SCC"]] } ],
            "expr": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_monthDayFactor", "v"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chainUnitConversion",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate", "args": [], "semiring": "sum_product", "output_idx": [],
            "ranges": { "v": { "from": "activity_point_rows" }, "r": { "from": "run_scc_rows" } },
            "join": [ { "on": [["Activity.act_SCC", "run_SCC"]] } ],
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "unit_conversion",
              "bindings": {
                "unit_code": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "emission_unit_g_per_hp_hr", "bindings": {} },
                "hp_avg": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_hpAvg", "v"] },
                "load_factor": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_loadFactor", "v"] },
                "activity_is_volumetric": { "op": ">", "args": [0.0, 0.5] },
                "fuel_density": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_medianLifeFullLoad", "v"] },
                "bsfc": 0.0
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "chainDeteriorationAge",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate", "args": [], "semiring": "sum_product", "output_idx": [],
            "ranges": { "v": { "from": "activity_point_rows" }, "r": { "from": "run_scc_rows" } },
            "join": [ { "on": [["Activity.act_SCC", "run_SCC"]] } ],
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "deterioration_age",
              "bindings": {
                "age_index": 0,
                "hours_used_per_year": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_activityLevel", "v"] },
                "load_factor": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_loadFactor", "v"] },
                "median_life_full_load": { "op": "index", "args": ["Activity.act_medianLifeFullLoad", "v"] }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "The whole chain in one contraction, across six mounts. Six `join.on` clauses: the roll-up's pollutant axis to the factor leaf's, both model-year sides to the run's year, the deterioration coefficients to the factor on the composite (polProcessID, engTechID), the adjustment to the factor on polProcessID, and the adjustment's fuel kind to this SCC's. Everything else is a product of scalars this document computed above from the upstream leaves.",
          "lhs": "chainEmissionGrams",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate", "args": [], "semiring": "sum_product", "output_idx": ["p"],
            "ranges": {
              "p": { "from": "rollup_pollutant_process_rows" },
              "f": { "from": "pollutant_process_rows" },
              "c": { "from": "engine_tech_rows" },
              "y": { "from": "mix_model_year_rows" },
              "d": { "from": "rollup_deterioration_rows" },
              "a": { "from": "adjustment_rows" },
              "g": { "from": "age_rows" },
              "m": { "from": "run_model_year_rows" },
              "k": { "from": "run_engine_fuel_kind_rows" }
            },
            "join": [
              { "on": [["Rollup.pp_polProcessID", "Factors.pp_polProcessID"]] },
              { "on": [["Factors.my_modelYearID", "run_modelYearID"]] },
              { "on": [["Age.age_modelYearID", "run_modelYearID"]] },
              { "on": [["Rollup.det_polProcessID", "Factors.pp_polProcessID"],
                       ["Rollup.det_engTechID", "Factors.tech_engTechID"]] },
              { "on": [["Adjust.adj_polProcessID", "Factors.pp_polProcessID"]] },
              { "on": [["Adjust.adj_engineFuelKindID", "run_engineFuelKindID"]] }
            ],
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                { "op": "index", "args": ["Factors.zeroHourRate", "c", "f"] },
                "chainUnitConversion",
                { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "deterioration_factor",
                  "bindings": {
                    "coefficient_a": { "op": "index", "args": ["Rollup.det_coefficientA", "d"] },
                    "age_exponent_b": { "op": "index", "args": ["Rollup.det_ageExponentB", "d"] },
                    "age_cap": { "op": "index", "args": ["Rollup.det_ageCap", "d"] },
                    "det_age": "chainDeteriorationAge"
                  } },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["Adjust.adjustment", "a"] },
                "Activity.adjustmentTime",
                "chainAnnualHours",
                "chainMonthDayFactor",
                "chainCountyPopulation",
                { "op": "index", "args": ["Age.age_grownModelYearFraction", "g"] },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["Factors.techFraction", "y", "c"] }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],

      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "the_population_and_geography_stages_meet",
          "description": "docs/nonroad-logging-county.md §6.1 step 1: round1dp(83.279224) x 0.0032382986 = 0.26975028. The number appears in no leaf — the population leaf stops at 83.3 and the geography leaf at the fraction — and it is what components/exhaust_rollup.esm carries as a parameter. A mismatch here would mean the roll-up had been calibrated against something the upstream stages do not produce.",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0 },
          "assertions": [
            { "variable": "chainCountyPopulation", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.2697502760384973 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the_activity_stage_supplies_what_the_rollup_multiplies",
          "description": "The three activity quantities the roll-up product needs, taken from the mounted stage 3 rather than from the roll-up leaf's parameter defaults: 303 hours a year, tpltmp 0.09722238, and cvttmp 4.767 from unitcf.f's g/hp-hr branch fed with stage 3's own hpAvg and loadFactor. The deterioration age at age slot 0 is 1.1104712, the same number components/age_distribution.esm derives from the same three inputs.",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0 },
          "assertions": [
            { "variable": "chainAnnualHours", "time": 0.0, "expected": 303.0 },
            { "variable": "chainMonthDayFactor", "time": 0.0, "expected": 0.09722237777770001 },
            { "variable": "chainUnitConversion", "time": 0.0, "expected": 4.767 },
            { "variable": "chainDeteriorationAge", "time": 0.0, "expected": 1.1104712041884817 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the_chain_reproduces_the_worked_examples_2020_rows",
          "description": "docs/nonroad-logging-county.md §6.1's four model-year-2020 rows — THC 269.139, CO 1205.140, NOx 6.923380, PM10 44.16030 grams in the snapshot — recomputed here from six mounted leaves: the emission factor the mix year selects (stage 4), the deterioration coefficients (stage 6's relation, J14), the two-stroke adjustment (stage 5), the activity and temporal factors (stage 3), the allocated population (stages 1 and 2), and the grown model-year fraction (stage 2c). The agreement is 2.0e-06 relative, which is the snapshot's own storage precision. Nothing in this equation reads a roll-up constant.",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0 },
          "assertions": [
            { "variable": "chainEmissionGrams", "time": 0.0, "expected": 269.13952383074087, "coords": { "rollup_pollutant_process_rows": 1 } },
            { "variable": "chainEmissionGrams", "time": 0.0, "expected": 1205.139540347985, "coords": { "rollup_pollutant_process_rows": 2 } },
            { "variable": "chainEmissionGrams", "time": 0.0, "expected": 6.923390114994544, "coords": { "rollup_pollutant_process_rows": 3 } },
            { "variable": "chainEmissionGrams", "time": 0.0, "expected": 44.16036911057205, "coords": { "rollup_pollutant_process_rows": 4 } }
          ]
        }
      ],

      "analyses": [
        {
          "id": "composed_emissions_by_pollutant_process",
          "description": "The run's output relation for model year 2020, plotted against its own key column. Four points, four orders of magnitude: CO dominates a two-stroke chain saw's exhaust and NOx is negligible, which is the shape of the fixture as a whole.",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0 },
          "plots": [
            {
              "id": "grams_by_pol_process",
              "type": "scatter",
              "description": "One point per selected pollutant process.",
              "x": { "variable": "Rollup.pp_polProcessID", "label": "polProcessID" },
              "y": { "variable": "chainEmissionGrams", "label": "emissionQuant (g)" }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the_chain_against_the_ambient_temperature",
          "description": "A sweep of the daytime averaging window's lower bound moves tamb, which moves the two-stroke adjustment — by nothing at all, because both two-stroke temperature coefficients are zero. The flat line IS the result: for a two-stroke engine the whole gasoline adjustment is the oxygenate term, and a port that had wired the four-stroke coefficients here would show a slope.",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.0 },
          "parameter_sweep": {
            "type": "cartesian",
            "dimensions": [
              { "parameter": "daytimeHourFirst", "values": [1.0, 7.0, 13.0, 19.0] }
            ]
          },
          "plots": [
            {
              "id": "grams_vs_window_start",
              "type": "line",
              "description": "Composed THC against the first hour of the ambient-temperature window.",
              "x": { "variable": "daytimeHourFirst", "label": "first hourID in the window" },
              "y": { "variable": "chainEmissionGrams", "label": "emissionQuant (g)" }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
